# Danger outline buttons

When a button is **outline-style with red/destructive text** (delete, disable, remove), use the shared `Button` variant — do not hand-roll red text on `variant="outline"`.

```tsx
// Correct
<Button variant="outlineDanger" size="sm">Delete user</Button>

// Wrong — red text without matching border
<Button variant="outline" className="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400">Delete</Button>
```

`outlineDanger` is defined in `frontend/src/components/ui/Button.tsx` (`text-danger` + `border-danger/30`, hover states included).

Solid filled destructive actions use `variant="danger"`.
